  message: "Fixed in PR #2198. All six producers reproduced and are fixed (starlark calls, cmake links, rst includes/toctree/roles, cuda, glsl, wgsl). whisper.cpp <unknown> path-slot nodes 361 -> 0 and id_format violations 361 -> 0; SwiftLint 21 -> 0; python-dependency-injector (90 .rst) 6 -> 0. grpc (213 starlark, 7 cmake, 1 rst in the item) was NOT re-run: 123 MB. starlark calls keep their 0.40 unresolved confidence (an existing test pins it), so they use the stand-in helper and not make_unresolved_edge."  # 5c19
